      6 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَصَافَيْنَا</span></b>  <i>We regarded one another,</i> or <i>acted
reciprocally, with purity,</i> or <i>sincerity,</i> [<i>of mind,</i>
or] <i>of love,</i> or <i>affection;</i> syn. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَخَالَصْنَا</span>. (S. [See
also 3.])

